# The FIPS release this package bundles when it is built for a release.
#
# A release must pin the FIPS version it carries: debian/fetch-fips-deb.sh
# takes the latest release when FIPS_TAG is unset, and vendor/ is not in
# git, so without a pin two builds of one tag can carry different binaries
# and nothing records which shipped.
#
# The pin lives here rather than being typed at build time so that it is
# part of the commit that gets tagged, reviewed with the rest of the
# release, and reproducible afterwards. .github/workflows/release.yml
# reads it; an ordinary build still takes the latest release.
#
# One tag, on its own line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
v0.5.0
